# Build-context hygiene (issue 084): images only COPY pyproject.toml,
# README.md, voyage/ and tests/ — everything below just inflates the
# transferred context (output/ alone is ~400 MB of frames/videos) and
# churns the layer cache on every render. Keep COPY sources unlisted here.
output/
.git
*_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Stray run artifacts at the Voyage root (mirrors .gitignore): a
# misdirected --output or local probe must never inflate the build
# context or churn the layer cache, esp. multi-hundred-MB media.
*.mp4
*.wav
*.flac
*.pt
*.log
issues/
reports/
